  "chapter": "GENESIS",
  "description": 'Finding yourself within a vast temple dedicated to a phoenix, a familiar stirring takes hold. You discover a library and are drawn to a single book: the Flaming Records. Within its pages, schematics and plans of incredible machines awaken something within you. A section on "PhoenixWare?" reveals only, "Power beyond reality, created by P⍑𝙹ᒷリ╎ ̇/⍊╎リᒷ—once one of us, now something more." You feel like you should know who this is, but the name escapes you. With a sense of unanswered questions, you exit the temple into the blinding light.

The world outside bears the marks of a vibrant community now overgrown, littered with the fascinating wreckage of broken machines and automation that sparks an unexpected excitement.

This is not a story of invention, but of reclamation.

This is: §4§lPhoenix Forge Technologies§r§r

And you WILL get back what you lost.',
